[assistant] {"action":"advisory_preparation","summary":"BC-FIPS is self-contained but meaningful coverage requires JCA provider registration and Native Image-specific provider/native-loader configuration.","deterministic_setup":[],"agent_guidance":"Register `new BouncyCastleFipsProvider()` with `Security.addProvider` before requesting BCFIPS algorithms. For native tests, add `-H:AdditionalSecurityProviders=org.bouncycastle.jcajce.provider.BouncyCastleFipsProvider` at image build time and set `org.bouncycastle.native.cpu_variant=java` for both image build (`-J-D...`) and runtime (`-D...`) to disable extraction of the artifact's bundled Linux JNI acceleration libraries.","risks":["Do not enable `org.bouncycastle.fips.approved_only` in shared tests: approved-only mode is irreversible for the current thread/process.","Provider registration only at runtime is insufficient for Native Image provider verification."]}
